---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: Legion operator transfers position
    q_check_caller --> q_check_from: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: fromAddress has active position
    q_check_from --> q_revert_no_position: no position to transfer
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_state: toAddress has no existing position
    q_check_to --> q_revert_exists: target already has position
    q_transfer_state --> q_clear_from: positions[toAddress] = positions[fromAddress]
    q_clear_from --> [*]: delete positions[fromAddress], emit PositionTransferred(from, to)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_no_position --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionExists

    note right of q_transfer_state
        INV-001: Position transfer is atomic (no partial transfers)
        INV-002: Total invested capital unchanged after transfer
        INV-003: Source position fully cleared after transfer
    end note
